<title>SWITZERLAND: Geneva March inflation 0.5 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Geneva March inflation 0.5 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consumer prices in the Swiss canton of Geneva fell 0.1 percent in March from the previous month for a year-on-year inflation rate of 0.5 percent, the cantonal statistics office said.</p>
<p>				   March 1997     Feb 1997    March 1996</p>
<p> Monthly CPI index change   - 0.1 pct     +0.8 pct	+1.0 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr inflation		+ 0.5 pct     +0.2 pct	+0.2 pct</p>
<p> Index (May 1993 = 100)	 104.5	   104.6	  104.0</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
